   "hasNotReadNotes": false,
   "text": "Tiler's tip: never order the exact square metres.\nCuts around walls, pipes and doorways eat tiles, and the odd one cracks. Add 10% to your area, or 15–20% for herringbone or diagonal layouts.\nRunning short mid-job hurts: a later batch can come up a slightly different shade.\nEvery tile page on our site has a calculator that works out the boxes for you.\nSave this for when you measure up.\n\n#perthtiles #porcelaintiles #bathroomtiles #floortiles #perthrenovation #bathroomrenovation #excellenttilingservices"
  }
 },
